Your customers, your prices and your invoices are yours. They are kept in your
own browser, they are never sent anywhere, and they come back out as XML and
plain JSON: readable without this app, and without us.

The app prepares the file. Sending it is yours to do: it does not transmit to
the SdI or to the HUB SM, it does not sign, and it does not keep the legal
archive. Those need an accredited channel and are obligations of their own.

No third-party code is bundled: the app has no dependencies, and the only code
it loads from outside this directory is the shared library in /app/_lib/, which
is ours and carries the same licence. The FatturaPA format is published by the
Agenzia delle Entrate; the schema itself is not redistributed here, and both the
emitter and the reader in run/fatturapa.js and run/reading.js are our own
implementation of the published specification.
